## Benefits

### Centralized Data Management
- ✅ All content in predictable locations
- ✅ Easy to find and edit data
- ✅ Single source of truth
- ✅ No scattered frontmatter

### Database-Ready Structure
- ✅ Easy migration to real database later
- ✅ Normalized relational structure
- ✅ Foreign key relationships
- ✅ Can export to SQL easily

### Better Tooling
- ✅ Can build admin UI
- ✅ Can validate with JSON Schema
- ✅ Can generate from external sources
- ✅ Can sync with CMS/database

### Scalability
- ✅ Add hundreds of services easily
- ✅ Bulk operations possible
- ✅ Better performance (pre-computed data)
- ✅ Easier to cache

